  "sourceTitle": "Electric Blue Martini",
  "sourceText": "Electric Blue Martini\nBy: Karina\nPublished: Sunday, May 15, 2011 - 8:25pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 ounce Alize Bleu\n1 ounce Stoli Citrus\n1/2 ounce sour mix\n1 Maraschino cherry\n\nPreparation\n\n1 In shaker  combine all ingredients with ice. Shake and strain into glass. Garnish with cherry\n\nAbout\n\n\nhttp://www.mrgiftcateringservices-trinidad.blogspot.com",
